Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		| testray.main.component.name | Deployment |

Set Up: This executes before each scenario
	Given SignIn sign In Test Setup


Scenario: Smoke
Description: Runs the smoke test on a non-root portal context.
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		| portal.acceptance                | true                |
		| portal.context                   | liferay             |
		| skip.clean-app-server-deploy-dir | true                |
		| test.assert.warning.exceptions   | true                |
		| test.name.skip.portal.instance   | PortalContext#Smoke |
	And Smoke view Welcome Page
	Then Smoke run Smoke